 character in the teas. This rare and exotic seasonal character expresses the fingerprint of nature in teas that are made with respect to nature-handpicked and handmade in the artisanal, orthodox style. A changing climate meant that we have not had an Uva Seasonal Flush Tea for five years, and that makes this one very special. Bright, with complex minty, eucalyptus merging with floral notes and soft astringency; an exceptional tea.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-ioUWZg flqMgp pf-0bf430aa494d-37_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvXgmx dsoEZT pf-0bf430aa494d-38_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="3a4163ac-8920-4d8a-8b4d-39441ccec016" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Auction Information</span></div></summary><div class="sc-bCMEPS dWLmZz pf-0bf430aa494d-40_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-cafhLY vCuXg pf-0bf430aa494d-41_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-0bf430aa494d-42_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dExXmK fNpoDq pf-0bf430aa494d-43_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS hqLKgJ pf-0bf430aa494d-44_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-9a190942-f541-472b-91e4-8343b103b983" class="sc-brPMkR jMxCJV"/><span class="sc-iMWBWc bZrdcI pf-paragraph-content ">A limited number of caddies are being auctioned online. You may place your bid for the numbered caddy of your choice, for instance caddy #07, #10 or #88. The auction goes live on 22nd November 2024 and ends on 10th December 2024. The starting bid price is USD$ 100. On the date of closing, the winning bidder will be contacted and their selected caddy will be shipped to them.<br><br>All proceeds from the Seasonal Flush 2024 Auction will be match-funded by Dilmah and go towards setting up a Dedicated Sensory Integration Room at the MJF Charitable Foundation Centre in Jaffna, Sri Lanka. Once equipped, this therapeutic space will cater to children with learning and physical disabilities, and it will be the first of its kind in the country’s north.
